          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP777 - FTR Hinton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N 53° 22.080 W 117° 37.952&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We decided to check out this fine cap on our way through town today and were pleasantly surprised at the ease of the find. We had to polish the cap up for the money shot, but that was no problem - thanks for another well positioned cap OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;

